audience: Technical leads and maintainers
purpose: Why is the document structure check run at write time and fed back to Claude?

Records moving the document structure check to write time via a PostToolUse hook that returns failures to Claude, while the review receipt check stays in the push gate and no Stop hook is used.
Translated from Korean to English; frontmatter, hook event names, exit code 2, the 20-second timeout and links to design 0001, ADR 0005 and ADR 0010 are unchanged.
Headings mapped to Decision, Background and Constraints, Rationale and Alternatives, Consequences.
The final bullet noting that ADR 0010 superseded the SessionStart counting is part of the source and is kept as-is.
No Korean literals retained.

